        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pinocchio (1940 film), Home on the Range (2004 film), \"I've Got No Strings\", Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937), The Adventures of Pinocchio\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Carlo Collodi, Dickie Jones\n- Topics: animated films, Disney films, songs\n\nFacts:\n- Pinocchio is a 1940 American animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and based on The Adventures of Pinocchio by Carlo Collodi.\n- After the success of Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs in 1937, Pinocchio became Disney's second animated feature film.\n- \"I've Got No Strings\", also known as \"I Got No Strings\", is a song from Pinocchio sung by Dickie Jones as Pinocchio.\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation and released by Walt Disney Pictures.",
